# Preconditions
# Run `pnpm seed`, start the API on http://localhost:3333, and use the legal
# catalog REST client to obtain the area/topic IDs for the context filter.

@url = {{BASE_URL}}/dynamic-forms

### Sign in as the seeded lawyer
# @name signInAsSeededLawyer
# @prompt seedPassword Enter HMS_USER_SEED_PASSWORD
POST {{BASE_URL}}/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "identifier": "lawyer@hmsadvogados.com.br",
  "password": "{{seedPassword}}"
}

### List all available dynamic forms
GET {{url}}
Authorization: Bearer {{signInAsSeededLawyer.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Search dynamic forms by name
GET {{url}}?search=triagem
Authorization: Bearer {{signInAsSeededLawyer.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Filter dynamic forms by legal context
GET {{url}}?legalAreaId=replace-with-legal-area-uuid&legalTopicId=replace-with-legal-topic-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{signInAsSeededLawyer.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json
